{"id":"78b7d00191e845b3","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence.md","title":"Elementary Equivalence","display":"df-first-order-elementary-equivalence — Elementary Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence","aliases":["93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence"],"display":"df-first-order-elementary-equivalence — Elementary Equivalence","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-elementary-equivalence — Elementary Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> are candidate typing conditions, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the sentence set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Elementary equivalence compares all sentences in one explicitly shared language; it is weaker than isomorphism and does not require the carriers to coincide.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1264,"backlinks":[{"id":"7383d8070afb35df","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1f813209c75e1"]}